  "title": "교육용 실물화상기 앱 - 갤럭시s9, s8에 미러링에서 가로모드 지원 및 표시가능",
  "author": "김정식(이천중)",
  "userid": "X1kP",
  "created": "18.03.26",
  "viewCnt": 433,
  "commentCnt": 3,
  "headCont": "",
  "contentval": "0007Izzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz",
  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/452",
  "contentHtml": "<p><br></p><p><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, UILanguageFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">갤럭시s9를 사용해 보니 스마트폰을 미러링 할때 다른 앱들은 가로모드가 지원이 되는데 실시간으로 보여주는 카메라의 경우에는 세로모드밖에 지원이 안된다.</span></p><p><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, UILanguageFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">스마트폰에서는 가로모드로 보여도, 미러링 된 TV에서는 항상 세로모드로 보여진다. </span></p><p><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, UILanguageFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">실물화상기 처럼 사용하고 싶은데 카메라가 세로모드로 보여지니 화면이 좁아 아쉬운점이 많았다.</span></p><p><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, UILanguageFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">그래서 가로모드로 보이게 전용앱(교육용 실물화상기)을 만들었다. 소프트웨어적으로 작동하는 거라 카메라에 비하면 화질이 많이 떨어진다. 하지만 수업시간에 무언가를 보여주는데는&nbsp; 지장이 없다.</span></p><p><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, UILanguageFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">만드는 김에 보여주다가 스마트폰 화면 아무대나 누르면 현재화면이 바로 정지화면으로 바뀌게 만들었다. 그 상태에서 위에다가 손가락으로 글을 쓰거나 표시를 할 수 있다.<br>(활동지를 보여주다 정지시킨 다음 그위에 무언가를 표시해 줄 수 있다.)</span></p><p><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, UILanguageFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span class=\"imageblock\" style=\"width: 620px; height: auto; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img width=\"620\" height=\"377\" style=\"height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/tistory/99FA8A3E5AAB5B0828\" filemime=\"image/jpeg\" filename=\"사용자 지정 3.png\" srcset=\"//img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R1920x0/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile26.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F99FA8A3E5AAB5B0828933E 1920w, //img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R960x0/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile26.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F99FA8A3E5AAB5B0828933E 960w, //img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R720x0/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile26.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F99FA8A3E5AAB5B0828933E 720w, //img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R640x0.q70/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile26.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F99FA8A3E5AAB5B0828933E 640w, //img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R480x0.q70/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile26.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F99FA8A3E5AAB5B0828933E 480w\"></span></span></p><p><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, UILanguageFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">또 </span></p><p><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, UILanguageFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">정지된 화면의 투명도를 조절해서 카메라에 비쳐지는 모습과 겹치게 만들었다.<br>옆에 아이가 만든 그래프랑 짝꿍이 만든 그래프를 화면을 겹쳐서 비교해 볼 수 있다.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; clear: none; float: none;\"><span class=\"imageblock\" style=\"width: 622px; height: auto; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img width=\"622\" height=\"374\" style=\"height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/tistory/99B0A23C5AAB5B6127\" filemime=\"image/jpeg\" filename=\"사용자 지정 2.png\" srcset=\"//img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R1920x0/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile3.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F99B0A23C5AAB5B6127BA29 1920w, //img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R960x0/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile3.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F99B0A23C5AAB5B6127BA29 960w, //img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R720x0/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile3.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F99B0A23C5AAB5B6127BA29 720w, //img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R640x0.q70/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile3.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F99B0A23C5AAB5B6127BA29 640w, //img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R480x0.q70/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile3.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F99B0A23C5AAB5B6127BA29 480w\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; clear: none; float: none;\"></p><p><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, UILanguageFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">그리기 모드를 끄면 정지된 화면을 확대하거나 축소할 수도 있다.</span></p><p><p><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, UILanguageFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">간단하지만 갤럭시S9를 사고 미러링해서 실물화상기처럼 사용할 수 없었던 문제를 직접 만들어 해결할 수 있었다.</span></p><p><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, UILanguageFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">추후에 화면에 각도기가 나오게 하거나, 화살표가 나오게 해도 좋을 것 같다.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, UILanguageFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong><u><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">안드로이드 앱은 구글플레이에서 '교육용 실물화상기' 라고 검색하거나 </span><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">아래 링크에서 설치할 수 있다. </span></u></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, UILanguageFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=air.com.sciencelove.s9horizontal\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong><u><font color=\"#0066cc\">https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=air.com.sciencelove.s9horizontal</font></u></strong></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, UILanguageFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">스마트폰을 교육용으로 미러링해서 실물화상기 처럼 사용할수 있게 만들었다.</span></p><p><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, UILanguageFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">윈도우10에서 별다른 장비 없이 안드로이드폰 미러링 하는 방법은 아래 링크 참고</span></p><p><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, UILanguageFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><a href=\"http://sciencelove.com/2188\"><strong><u><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 18pt;\">http://sciencelove.com/2188</span></u></strong></a></span></p><p><br style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, UILanguageFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"></p><p>아래는 플레이스토어에 소개된 문구이다.</p><p><br style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, UILanguageFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, UILanguageFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">1. 앱을 만든 가장 큰 이유는 갤럭시s9, s8에서 카메라 화면을 실시간으로 미러링 해서 보여줄때 가로모드로 바뀌지 않고 세로모드로만 보여지도록 되어 있다.<span>&nbsp;</span></span><br style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, UILanguageFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, UILanguageFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">그래서 소프트웨어적으로 가로모드로 볼 수 있게 만들었다.<span>&nbsp;</span></span><br style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, UILanguageFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, UILanguageFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, UILanguageFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">2. 실물화상기처럼 학습자료를 비추다가 화면을 터치하면 화면이 캡쳐되서 정지화면이 되도록 했다. 중요한 자료를 흔들림 없이 제시할 수 있다.<span>&nbsp;</span></span><br style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, UILanguageFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, UILanguageFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, UILanguageFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">3. 정지화면을 확대 축소 할 수 있고, 투명도를 조절하면 실시간으로 보여지는 화면 위에 사진이 인쇄된 투명필름이 있는 듯한 효과를 낼 수 있다.<span>&nbsp;</span></span><br style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, UILanguageFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, UILanguageFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">방금찍은 학습자료와 지금 보여지는 학습자료를 투명도를 조절해 가며 비교할 수 있다.<span>&nbsp;</span></span><br style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, UILanguageFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, UILanguageFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span st